{
  "name": "IIoT - Resumo diário de produção no WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Resumo diário de produção\n\nA plataforma chama este webhook quando um dia de produção fecha (turnos encerrados e a máquina parada há 30 min, hora extra incluída) — **uma mensagem por vez**, das 07h às 21h e com no mínimo 3 min entre envios. Quem acumula os fechamentos das 17h e dá o ritmo é a fila da plataforma; aqui só se envia.\n\n1. Preencha **Configuração**.\n2. Ative e copie a URL de produção do nó **Resumo recebido** para a variável **N8N_SUMMARY_WEBHOOK_URL** da plataforma (Coolify).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "613afbdd-ad1d-4487-8d5f-419a227f14ba",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "everlenz-iiot-resumo",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0ffe20d4-843b-4a52-8ac8-4670209cb166",
      "name": "Resumo recebido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "2ec0d833-a1d2-41a9-8eba-b873a0903e68"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a82785ae-a700-4584-b06f-ef529e8a3691",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_URL",
              "value": "https://iotplataform.everlenz.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b88bafb0-2180-4ea6-9279-e62f1f07e4d7",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_CHAVE",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_N8N_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "16f1bc9e-dd62-4ff1-b134-262d6ef98a31",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_URL",
              "value": "https://evolutionapi.assistentedrfin.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f6d00360-0cbd-4d4d-b22b-87e2dc75d097",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA",
              "value": "NOME_DA_INSTANCIA",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0788af23-4e28-47e7-ac1a-51435f6f1049",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_APIKEY",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_APIKEY_DA_EVOLUTION",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c319e20a-5c59-4d63-a50a-a3be25c22272",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c942b5a5-854d-4727-8c1b-1a1d6a2454bf",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.headers['x-n8n-key'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8d597e2a-f9fe-4e9e-8860-b4c3f4647a92",
      "name": "Chave válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "0326861d-3bbb-40a5-b655-ace27c10298f",
      "name": "Ignora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.waitSeconds || 10 }}"
      },
      "id": "7e9b492d-a654-4c79-b065-5020b176cef2",
      "name": "Espera aleatória",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL }}/message/sendText/{{ encodeURIComponent($('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "delay",
              "value": "={{ 1500 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 2500) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "presence",
              "value": "composing"
            },
            {
              "name": "linkPreview",
              "value": "={{ false }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "a69e45d0-7b54-46d5-aeaa-413ecd210020",
      "name": "Envia resumo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: true } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "24746a0c-01b8-4b30-8f78-63d66a516715",
      "name": "Confirma envio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: false, error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.message ?? 'falha na Evolution').slice(0, 400) } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6ec913d0-6821-468e-a156-441b60e6b35d",
      "name": "Registra falha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
